{"seq":4,"slug":"time-series-analysis","title":"时间序列分析","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":19,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"时间序列分析-简介\">时间序列分析 简介</h1><p>时间序列分析是处理按时间顺序排列的数据点序列的统计方法体系。从股票价格波动到电商销量预测，从服务器负载监控到天气预报，时间序列数据无处不在。掌握时间序列分析方法是数据科学家在众多业务场景中提供价值的核心能力之一。</p>\n<p>本知识库系统讲解时间序列分析从基础理论到实际应用的完整知识链条，面向数据科学家、量化分析师和需要进行预测分析的技术人员。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>时间序列基础</strong>建立时间序列分析的理论基石，介绍核心概念、平稳性与分解方法以及自相关分析等基础工具。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>时间序列模型</strong>深入讲解主流时间序列建模方法，从经典的ARIMA模型族到指数平滑方法，再到前沿的深度学习时序模型。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>预测方法</strong>聚焦时间序列预测的工程实践，涵盖预测框架设计、集成预测方法和预测效果的评估与校准。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>应用场景</strong>将理论方法落地到具体业务领域，探讨金融时间序列、需求预测和时序异常检测三大典型应用场景。</p>\n<p>建议读者从第1章的基础理论开始，扎实掌握概念后再学习模型和预测方法，最后通过应用场景将知识转化为实践能力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ts-fundamentals","title":"时间序列基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-series-concepts","title":"时间序列基本概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-fundamentals/time-series-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stationarity-decomposition","title":"平稳性与时序分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-fundamentals/stationarity-decomposition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"autocorrelation-analysis","title":"自相关分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-fundamentals/autocorrelation-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ts-models","title":"时间序列模型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arima-models","title":"ARIMA 模型族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-models/arima-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exponential-smoothing","title":"指数平滑与状态空间模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-models/exponential-smoothing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-learning-ts","title":"深度学习时序模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-models/deep-learning-ts"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ml-time-series","title":"时间序列机器学习方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-models/ml-time-series"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ts-forecasting","title":"预测方法","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forecast-evaluation","title":"预测评估与模型选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecast-evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ensemble-forecasting","title":"集成预测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/ensemble-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forecast-evaluation","title":"预测评估与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecast-evaluation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"forecasting-framework","title":"预测框架体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecasting-framework"},{"seq":5,"slug":"multistep-hierarchical","title":"多步预测与层级预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/multistep-hierarchical"},{"seq":6,"slug":"forecasting-systems","title":"预测系统工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecasting-systems"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ts-applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anomaly-detection","title":"时间序列异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/anomaly-detection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"changepoint-trend","title":"变点检测与趋势分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/changepoint-trend"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection-ts","title":"时序异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/anomaly-detection-ts"},{"seq":4,"slug":"financial-ts","title":"金融时间序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/financial-ts"},{"seq":5,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/demand-forecasting"},{"seq":6,"slug":"causal-inference-ts","title":"时间序列因果推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/causal-inference-ts"}]}]}